<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>The best timing macro sniper in "Point Blank", can be used for all sniper, easy to use with an accurately adjusted time to make your game more enjoyable.

macros built with fully guaranteed customization, error free, and easy to use.

- Set macro on right click button
- must be used with quick change item</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>RightDown 1
Delay 64 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 64 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 25 ms
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 19 ms
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 19 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 19 ms
KeyDown 30 1
Delay 19 ms
GoWhile 1 2
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 390 ms
IfKey 7 0 24
Goto 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>